{
  "id": "ss.char.blok",
  "name": "Blok",
  "description": "The one that put on everything it could find. A flat-top of gold hair like a block set on the head, brows down and mouth flat — braced, not cross — and a chest plate with the rivets still on it over a body a size wider than the others, on limbs a quarter thicker. A beetle's closed elytra ride the back like a shell it never opens, and spore pods hang where a pack would: one racked behind the shoulder, one at the hip, each with the cold fuse the pod always carries. Same dead organ as the rest, worn as a brooch on the plate; same bobble feelers, short and stubby here. Drawn facing +x; the game flips it.",
